				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>Our Mission</h2>
<p><span class="relative -mx-px my-&#091;-0.2rem&#093; rounded px-px py-&#091;0.2rem&#093;">At the <strong>ABA</strong>, we work closely with the Arkansas Game and Fish Commission to advocate for bowhunters&#8217; rights and opportunities.</span> <span class="relative -mx-px my-&#091;-0.2rem&#093; rounded px-px py-&#091;0.2rem&#093;">Our goal is to balance commerce and conservation, ensuring that future generations can enjoy bowhunting as we do today.</span></p></div>
			</div>
