<p><span class="relative -mx-px my-&#091;-0.2rem&#093; rounded px-px py-&#091;0.2rem&#093;">As a self-funded organization, the ABA relies on membership participation, fees, and generous donations to fund our activities.</span> <span class="relative -mx-px my-&#091;-0.2rem&#093; rounded px-px py-&#091;0.2rem&#093;">Your support enables us to continue our advocacy, education, and community-building efforts.</span></p></div>
